FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.24.6-alpine3.22@sha256:c8c5f95d64aa79b6547f3b626eb84b16a7ce18a139e3e9ca19a8c078b85ba80d AS build

ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
WORKDIR /src

COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY *.go ./
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH \
    go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w -buildid=" -o /out/smtp2ntfy .

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot@sha256:1b7b9f0f0e0a1d2155f531db587cc48ec26aaf97ab64364225f5bf18a054e66a

COPY --from=build /out/smtp2ntfy /smtp2ntfy
USER 65532:65532
EXPOSE 2525
ENTRYPOINT ["/smtp2ntfy"]
